id: pm-vcs-zj42
title: Adopt current pm SDK and release-tooling dependencies in Phase 2
description: "Move the unreleased pm-vcs rewrite branch from pm CLI 2026.7.29, pm-changelog 2026.7.26, and Node types 26.1.1 to the current registry releases before review."
