acceptance_criteria: "package.json and package-lock.json resolve @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.7.31, pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1, and @types/node 26.1.2; clean install, 100/100/100 coverage, audit, pack, changelog, npm, and Bun checks pass"
resolution: "Updated dependency contracts, removed invalid successful exit_code payloads for the 2026.7.31 SDK, and verified clean package graphs and packed installs."
expected_result: "Current dependencies resolve and all npm, Bun, coverage, audit, package, changelog, and installed-extension gates pass."
actual_result: Dependencies resolve at the requested releases; no vulnerabilities; exact 100% coverage; npm and Bun fresh projects activate and execute pm-vcs successfully.
