comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T11:44:36.258Z","harness:codex","Registry verification on 2026-07-31 found pm CLI 2026.7.31, pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1, @types/node 26.1.2, and TypeScript 7.0.2 latest."
notes[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T11:44:36.258Z","harness:codex",Preserve the companion decision that new packages remain unpublished until maintainer approval.
  "2026-07-31T11:59:32.885Z","harness:codex","Adopted @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.7.31, pm-changelog 2026.7.29-1, and @types/node 26.1.2. The stricter SDK exposed invalid successful exit_code:0 payloads; removed them and pinned the contract. Clean npm ci and Bun install pass; 341-test coverage gate is 100/100/100; audit has 0 vulnerabilities; npm pack and changelog gates pass; fresh npm and Bun installed-package probes activate all 27 commands."
  "2026-07-31T12:04:13.727Z","harness:codex","Fresh-package validation also exposed an upstream pm CLI agent-UX gap: local npm tarballs are rejected as non-directory package sources. Filed unbraind/pm-cli#844 with safe extraction and provenance requirements; validation continued through the installed unpacked package directory."
  "2026-07-31T12:27:04.825Z","harness:codex","The recorded 341-test count was the exact passing scope when this item closed. The subsequent portable source-workspace regression added one test, making the Phase 2 final gate 342 before review; PR review follow-up later expands the suite again. Append-only history intentionally preserves each time-scoped result."
  "2026-08-06T22:13:28.470Z",codex,"The 2026.8.6 SDK always supplies the host-bound client on normal invocations, revealing that the legacy tracker-bound fallback lacked a direct behavioral test. Added a fresh-workspace init/list acceptance case; no coverage threshold or source exclusion changed."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-31T11:44:36.258Z","harness:codex",An unreleased package still needs current SDK validation; release gating and dependency currency are independent controls.
